pan><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">code </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">pp)</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">++</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:4ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">if</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> (code </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">==</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> SHARP_s) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:8ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">if</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> (flags </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">&#x26;</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> ONIGENC_CASE_UPCASE) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:12ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">5</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">to</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">++</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">'S'</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">              /* first byte */</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:12ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">6</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">            </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">code </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">'S'</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:8ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">7</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">        </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:8ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">8</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">        </span></span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">/* ... */</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:4ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">9</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">    </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:4ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">10</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">    </span></span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">/* ... */</span></div></div><div class="ec-line" style="--ecIndent:4ch"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">11</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">to</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">++</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> code;</span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">                     /* second byte, unchecked */</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">12</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="Copy to clipboard" data-copied="Copied!" data-code="while (*pp < end &#x26;&#x26; to < to_end) {    /* room for one byte */    code = *(*pp)++;    if (code == SHARP_s) {        if (flags &#x26; ONIGENC_CASE_UPCASE) {            *to++ = &#x27;S&#x27;;              /* first byte */            code = &#x27;S&#x27;;        }        /* ... */    }    /* ... */    *to++ = code;                     /* second byte, unchecked */}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
The output buffer is allocated as the input length plus 20
              bytes. Each <code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>ß</code> adds one byte to the output, so an
              input with 21 of them overflows the buffer by one byte.
</p> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
The same loop is in several ISO-8859 and Windows-125x encodings
              and has been there since Ruby 2.4.0. It is reached by
<code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>upcase</code>, <code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>swapcase</code>,
<code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>downcase(:fold)</code> and <code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>casecmp?</code>.
</p> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
UTF-8 strings take a different code path and are not affected.
</p> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
Fixed upstream in
<a href="https://github.com/ruby/ruby/commit/d582f8f13d700d8e39714d3a8f11eb4bd2bc69f0" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi" data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi><code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>ruby/ruby@d582f8f</code></a>.
</p> <h3 id="primitive">Primitive <a data-heading-anchor href="#primitive" aria-label="Link to this section" tabindex="-1"></a></h3> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
A one-byte heap overflow. The byte written is <code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>S</code>
(<code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>0x53</code>) when upcasing or <code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>s</code>
(<code data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>0x73</code>) when case-folding, and it lands directly
              after the output buffer. The attacker controls the size of the
              buffer through the input length.
</p> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
Copying the result out of the buffer then reads one byte out of
              bounds.
</p> </div> </section> <section data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi> <h2 id="poc">Proof of concept <a data-heading-anchor href="#poc" aria-label="Link to this section" tabindex="-1"></a></h2> <div data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
We'll be publishing a proof of concept demonstrating remote code
              execution on stock Rails on
<strong data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi><time datetime="2026-11-25" data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>25 November 2026</time></strong>, or later if major vendors have not shipped a fix by then.
</p> </div> </section> <section data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi> <h2 id="credits">Credits <a data-heading-anchor href="#credits" aria-label="Link to this section" tabindex="-1"></a></h2> <div data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
Veria Labs found this vulnerability independently and was the
              first to demonstrate remote code execution.
</p> <p data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>
The
<a href="https://www.ruby-lang.org/en/news/2026/11/18/multiple-vulnerabilities-in-regexp-and-string/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi" data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>Ruby security advisory</a>
also credits Stephan Lipp (Ada Logics) and Anthropic with reporting
              the underlying primitive. Additional discoverers include
<a href="https://durendal.sh/blog/ruby-case-mapping-bugs" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi astro-st7rnsyi" data-astro-cid-st7rnsyi>Moritz Sanft</a> in collaboration with OpenAI.
</p> </div> </section> </prose-content> </article> </main> <page-footer data-astro-cid-ju4pidww="true"><footer data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk> <div class="top" data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk> <a class="mark" href="/" aria-label="Veria Labs" data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk><svg width="495" height="587" viewBox="0 0 495 587" fill="none" data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk="true">
